  id: WildBeastPen
  displayName: Beast Pen
  description: A stockade, a cage and some very brave tamers. They tame wolves and
    boar (bears and mammoths from the Bronze Age) from the herds within 18 tiles
    into war beasts that fight for you. Keeps 2 (+1 per upgrade); they eat a little
    food.
